#: templates/gcd/bits/tw_front_page_content.html:32
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    The <b>Grand Comics Database (GCD)</b> is a nonprofit, internet-based "
"organization of international volunteers\n"
"    dedicated to building an open database covering all printed comics "
"throughout the world.</p>\n"
"  <p> Give <a class=\"link-no-visited font-bold\" "
"href=\"%(search_url)s\">our search</a> a try, use <a class=\"link-no-visited "
"font-bold\" href=\"https://my.comics.org/\">my.comics.org</a> to track and "
"manage\n"
"    your comic collection, or look how\n"
"    you can <a class=\"link-no-visited font-bold\" "
"href=\"#how_to_contribute\">contribute</a>.\n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Prova ad effettuare una <a class=\"link-no-visited font-bold\" "
"href=\"%(search_url)s\">ricerca</a> oppure usa <a class=\"link-no-visited "
"font-bold\" href=\"https://my.comics.org/\">my.comics.org</a> "
"per monitorare e gestire la tua collezione di fumetti. "
"  "

#: templates/gcd/bits/tw_front_page_content.html:66 templates/gcd/index.html:59
msgid "Disclaimer"
msgstr "Avvertenze"

#: templates/gcd/bits/tw_front_page_content.html:69 templates/gcd/index.html:63
msgid ""
"The Grand Comics Database Project (GCD) is a volunteer project with the goal "
"of documenting and indexing all comics for the free use of scholars, "
"historians, researchers, and fans."
msgstr ""
"Il Grand Comics Database Project (GCD) è un progetto internazionale di "
"volontariato senza scopo di lucro, con l'obiettivo di catalogare tutti i "
"fumetti per la libera consultazione di studenti, storici, ricercatori e "
"appassionati. "

#: templates/gcd/bits/tw_front_page_content.html:72 templates/gcd/index.html:66
msgid ""
"The GCD acknowledges that the all-encompassing research nature of the "
"project may result in the posting of cover scans for comics with images that "
"some may find objectionable."
msgstr ""
"Il GCD riconosce che la natura omnicomprensiva del progetto di catalogazione "
"può portare alla pubblicazione di scansioni di copertina che alcuni "
"potrebbero ritenere offensive."

#: templates/gcd/bits/tw_front_page_content.html:75 templates/gcd/index.html:69
msgid "Viewer discretion is advised."
msgstr "Si consiglia cautela nella visualizzazione dei contenuti."

#: templates/gcd/bits/tw_front_page_content.html:78 templates/gcd/index.html:72
